DESCRIPTION >
    Immutable migration-time identity base for reporting facts. Activated mapping
    deltas override this value at read time, so retroactive identity changes remain live.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` String `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `fact_kind` String `json:$.fact_kind`,
    `fact_id` String `json:$.fact_id`,
    `profile_id` Nullable(String) `json:$.profile_id`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tenant_id, fact_kind, fact_id
